<![CDATA[Dear&nbsp;{!Lead.FirstName},<div><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><div><span style="font-size: 12pt;">I wanted to share these videos with you- some recorded by our owners talking about our company's culture and investment philosophies, and also some from our clients, talking about their experience working with Memphis Invest</span></div><div><br></div><div>First, <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d5P7wDuBswQ&amp;index=6&amp;list=PLR9u_WowgmHqvUdXN1sZmzQOJOuIFBEd_&amp;t=192s">start right here and hear the Memphis Invest story </a>told by the Clothier family, owners of Memphis Invest.</div><div><br></div><div>These next few videos answer some of our most frequently asked questions overall:</div><div><br></div><div><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V8lu1aeirHY&amp;index=7&amp;list=PLR9u_WowgmHqvUdXN1sZmzQOJOuIFBEd_">How do I get started?</a></div><div><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SXfMethkcyE&amp;t=48s">Why do I need to build a portfolio vs. just buying 1 property?</a></div><div><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vKHIEJcNB_0&amp;t=34s">Why did you choose Memphis, Dallas, Houston, Little Rock, and Oklahoma City as your markets?</a></div><div><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XCOjFpDkBk0&amp;t=331s">What should I be looking for when selecting the right turnkey partner?</a></div><div><br></div><div>Ok, so you've heard from the owners, but you also REALLY need to hear it from investors that have been with us for several years.</div><div><br></div><div>So start right <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KVIFV5Ob7BQ&amp;t=28s">here</a>&nbsp;and then keep going <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iDXFJs29D_o&amp;t=85s">right here</a>, and if you still need convincing that we are the best in our industry, go ahead and watch <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ol9-pxqJBGc">this one</a> and <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OgcFDsRjJz0">that one.</a></div><div><br></div><div>This next link is the most important of all. This one puts you on the path. If you feel fairly certain that we are the right fit for you as a company and that you would be a great client for us, <a href="https://my-schedule.timetrade.com/app/td-1259187/workflows/rzlm2/schedule/availability?wfsid=16a5bdc5-baba97f6-16a5bdbe-baba97f6-00000002-vgcrskkc83sg1tcg41g8dlu53vorvbea&amp;view=full&amp;fs=1">click right here to schedule a call with me and let's get this thing going!</a></div><div><br></div><div>Looking forward to talking with you soon.</div><div><br></div><div>Sincerely,</div><div><br></div><div>Marq</div><div><br></div><div><br class="Apple-interchange-newline"><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">--&nbsp;</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: small;"><div class="gmail_signature" data-smartmail="gmail_signature" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: small;"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><br><div><span style="font-family: georgia, serif; border-collapse: separate;"><div><font color="#000000" face="verdana, sans-serif"><b>Marq Cobb</b></font></div><div><span style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;"><font color="#000000">Memphis Invest, GP</font></span></div><div><span style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;"><font color="#000000"><br></font></span></div></span><div><div><img src="https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/P-ZUATG-9KvjtTCYPKyMYZvbZ1icP24mB3AQG8FiodVo-sdJ2JgTowsNbAbkh7l2lFLFbGwo2IeCTAWCabhVQv1K4a8rul-WiunKnoxlWZI0uzWqL8S3lDRln2IqOfbrtqKAikZg-5guzwjsB7ufNvHZ26--Z-xThtVQ2w=s0-d-e1-ft#http://info.memphisinvest.com/hs-fs/hub/44341/file-2286025665-png/Memphis-Invest-Logo-email-footer.png"><br></div><div><br></div><div><font face="arial" size="2"><b style="border-collapse: separate; line-height: 24px;"><a href="https://www.timetrade.com/book/